00Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"ujxbw5icn7kbreexedfelwgt0","title":"Airbnb 如何通过成本每任务优化 Amazon Bedrock 上的编码智能体部署","summary":"Airbnb 通过成本每任务和实时监控优化智能体部署，指导模型选择与资源分配。具体方法包括：1）在模型发布后立即运行自定义任务集的评估（evals），记录每个模型在8个维度的得分及成本；2）通过CloudWatch监控生产环境指标（如请求延迟、令牌消耗），对比评估结果与实际使用差异；3）根据成本/任务和性能调整默认模型及推理强度上限。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-airbnb-uses-cost-per-task-to-operate-coding-agents-on-amazon-bedrock/","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T21:48:19.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"gymsfhqqd2azbb7ul6hf75gb5","title":"AWS SageMaker JumpStart 模型排行榜发布","summary":"AWS 发布 SageMaker JumpStart 模型排行榜，提供标准化评测方法及模型选择指南，涵盖 70+ 模型（包括 Meta、Google、Qwen 等）的质量、速度和成本对比，支持用户按需筛选和部署。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-the-amazon-sagemaker-jumpstart-model-leaderboard/","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T22:31:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a6