-get-hacked/","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T17:32:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"uq0fpbhjggmmt0o5rn04a5nxu","title":"Nvidia新CEO调整供应链策略，限制对云公司的支持","summary":"Nvidia新CEO科莱特·克雷斯在财报电话会议中明确表示将限制对未完成基础设施建设的云公司的支持，并透露新加坡市场贡献了2025年1040亿美元收入。文中指出黄仁勋离职后供应链管理出现变化，同时提到美国联邦储备可能加息影响数据中心建设融资。作者还披露Nvidia未购买高管责任险，面临SEC调查及加州总检察长介入。","sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1036776/nvidia-earnings-kress-jensen-huang-petition","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T18:34:15.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"tu5kj46se2ulompc3omgwdu0k","title":"Stretto利用Amazon Nova 2 Sonic构建AI语音助手Tara","summary":"Stretto通过Amazon Nova 2 Sonic和Claude 3 Haiku构建的AI语音助手Tara使破产咨询转化率提升20%，成本降低95%。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-stretto-built-an-ai-voice-agent-with-amazon-nova-2-sonic/","publishedAt":"2026-11-18T18:58:42.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":9,"modelsReleased":0,"firstPartyEvents":4},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-11-18","next":null}